Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.82,0:00:38.03,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\fs19.24}Another new season has come around in this familiar town
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:49.41,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Petals scatter in the air, just for you, into the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:01:00.42,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,I suddenly felt like I heard your familiar voice
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.42,0:01:09.26,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Feeling that way as well, looking back alone today
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.26,0:01:13.57,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Blowing in the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.57,0:01:16.57,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Can you feel me? Still remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.57,0:01:24.88,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,The farther apart we are, the closer our hearts stay
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:36.19,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\fs17.74}Please keep watching over me, until the day we can meet again
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.23,0:01:51.50,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\fs18.94}The path we once walked side by side, the words we shared
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:02:02.78,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,They haven't disappeared, sleep my dear, let it all rest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.78,0:02:14.13,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\fs18.13}The pain of that day, searching for the meaning of being apart
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:26.94,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\fs16.34}But now I carry only the joy of having met you, precious thing for me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:30.15,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me? Remain forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:38.29,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Whenever I stop in my tracks, I find myself asking you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.29,0:02:49.60,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\fs15.4}If every tear makes me stronger, then I know I can keep moving forward
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.97,0:03:03.51,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Let's stop counting everything we have lost and just live
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:15.02,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\fs18.82}When the light breaks through the gaps between the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:43.62,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Can you feel me? Still remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:51.73,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,The farther apart we are, the closer our hearts stay
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:04:02.97,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\fs17.74}Please keep watching over me, until the day we can meet again
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:06.17,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me? Remain forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.17,0:04:14.32,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Whenever I stop in my tracks, I find myself asking you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.32,0:04:25.59,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,{\fs15.4}If every tear makes me stronger, then I know I can keep moving forward
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:28.96,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Can you feel me? Still remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:36.87,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Stay in my heart, eternally
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.87,0:04:40.24,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me? Remain forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:48.15,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Stay by my side
